WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back, knees bent, feet hip-width.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Press up into a bridge.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lift one foot, then the other, marching slowly.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep hips from dropping.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Lower vertebra by vertebra.
